      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    interest_paid = 36000\n    mortgage_debt = 900000\n    acquisition_date = \"2020-01-10\"\n    filing_status = \"single\"\n    cutoff_date = \"2017-12-15\"\n    \n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    if acquisition_date <= cutoff_date:\n        debt_limit = 1000000\n    elif filing_status == \"married filing separately\":\n        debt_limit = 375000\n    else:\n        debt_limit = 750000\n\n    deductible_interest = interest_paid * min(1, debt_limit / mortgage_debt)\n    answer = round(deductible_interest)\n    \n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
